        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As of December 31, 2025, we do not directly own or lease our warehousing facilities, but utilize third-party vendors to provide warehousing services, except that we leased a warehouse of approximately 1,500 square meters in Wuhan China.",
