        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As we strive to steadily increase our business scale and expand our teahouse network, we have developed a comprehensive set of rigorous policies and procedures to effectively manage the steady growth of our teahouse network.",
