        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Furthermore, we leverage the expertise of our in-house branding and marketing professionals to develop a holistic promotion plan for the new product, while working closely with our operational center to create standardization manuals and employee training courses, preparing all fronts for the seamless launch of the new addition to our CHAGEE product family.",
